      "message": "It\u0027s a little subtle here that CreateHeaderAndroid happens to not use a data descriptor by default.  In my failed attempts I was trying to make CreateHeader detect whether or not to use the data descriptor, but it can\u0027t always know ahead of time if the file will fit in a zip32 file header, so I like your explicit approach better.  Maybe rename CreateHeaderAndroid to CreateHeaderWithoutDataDescriptor to be explicit?",
